{"title": "Komira's Locket", "pageid": 3444, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Komira's_Locket", "categories": ["Amulets", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Faded.webp/300px-Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Faded.webp, /w/images/6/60/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Komira's Locket image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Faded.webp/300px-Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Komira's Locket</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulet</a> given to the party by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arabella\" title=\"Arabella\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png/25px-Portrait_Arabella.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png/38px-Portrait_Arabella.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png/50px-Portrait_Arabella.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arabella's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png/25px-Portrait_Arabella.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Portrait_Arabella.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arabella\" title=\"Arabella\">Arabella's</a> parents.\nGrants its wearer the ability to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights\" title=\"Dancing Lights\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/25px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/38px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/50px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dancing Lights\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/25px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights\" title=\"Dancing Lights\">Dancing Lights</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Worked carefully into the locket's metal back are the words, 'Never dark again.'\n</p>\n</div></